{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:eee9e0f18ab772af0d09672992954b574d0f305bad8a9cb07f6e928c44108132",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d95f9edd3454d66bbc0db9fe2f4af50418c64fc953eac057b5036e9dc10242e6",
      "text": "突击采访夏来君！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de396119044cc57f77332a868dcfe06321cb55b5267081c24395a1c1ad65b3ce",
      "text": "夏来要在面向青少年的杂志上\n刊登写真与访谈。\n他和制作人一起进行内容确认，\n但夏来的回答却似乎有些答非所问……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d95f9edd3454d66bbc0db9fe2f4af50418c64fc953eac057b5036e9dc10242e6",
      "text": "突击采访夏来君！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:202d6e6e364b7bcd8bac2da219296f111c894d05875cb5e930ff1ff82557ab78",
      "text": "制作人，辛苦了。\n新工作，是什么样的？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea00739a29929a46fe4c9c5fc135f8256ce41649f51fbb9f47497ac2c381e640",
      "text": "辛苦了。面向青少年的杂志编辑发来了邀约，\n希望能做一期夏来先生的特辑。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:705dba38e3283944f4c930e77a31e75e5860a25564774d65910f5539e66b0223",
      "text": "给我的，特辑……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c16b2cc8a642b3da2ff76e6044424e3b296784b6e4125e5453283b3d290fcd3b",
      "text": "是的！据说是写真拍摄加访谈。\n详情请看这里。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2f730058c2c8ef300ea93ac059e073a5cd9193ed2d1eeef323b49f486af3fa0",
      "text": "我知道了……虽然一个人的话有点不安……\n但我会和●●●●プロデューサー一起努力的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c201dbbfba71fca41b99a23dfc970d393c8ce8641ab5b46fdd72a693938ff139",
      "text": "问卷……我回答的内容……\n制作人也会帮忙确认的吧……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4bf1e678936d322ef862f3e72efda34205f46656b041e55d34c987c178a409b",
      "text": "是的，我会确认的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1ebade959c5f9605b58f6f1ecf4931363d209ac1d2374ddc6506d8477930ba0",
      "text": "那……我现在回答可以吗……？\n这样也能一起确认……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a758f0e4662fb00309f7bedb468c4a8289445671b01c71add965728c217d0e8",
      "text": "当然可以！\n那么，我们这就开始提问吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_a:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cad050d837cce6a296a7c4f9323dc640e109290e15f60094726df72f82b657a8",
      "text": "（这次的采访有很多跟恋爱相关的内容呢。\n夏来先生会给出怎样的回答呢？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_b:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6abd86a96aea711fd0af2efe39ad388e3963c5aca43ac84df93c20e800e84ecc",
      "text": "那么，请听第一个问题。有令你印象深刻的\n情人节回忆吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e019d867a60083b8879e55fd27ccacd92157ff2a1bedbb3f63b4552521ac5a1",
      "text": "嗯……情人节的，回忆……\n收到过妹妹手工做的巧克力……吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac8ab6d8c5d73e4a29d0e418573befeaaed735bd65aba1dbb7d42e13d7797cd2",
      "text": "她在奶奶的，帮忙下……\n送了我带闪闪发光装饰的，巧克力……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e670a556e52e6d39e330932c2e4e3536c56032f08aca0fb6e03992e52f9f9434",
      "text": "真的，好开心啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eeefc5dd740aae8f59aad6de4ef6ff6ad6ae0acac5fe02374bfa991b042ad2f1",
      "text": "（……虽然可能跟原本的主旨不太一样，\n但真是个温馨又美好的故事呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf92d7912230b76d47385c16b7d3125ce20c73f080b1ec488a9e20974975a07e",
      "text": "那么下一个问题。\n最近有什么让你心跳加速的事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a22ccc3838012f8e669b0b4bfef305674afd247689b6d9edf83776e121ed4dae",
      "text": "嗯……半夜醒过来的时候，在枕头边上，\n我家的猫正低头看着我……吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:783609e5d2d44bca9de1f25fe1bd15d6caeec22d4f25c612cd3c83656ea7120a",
      "text": "猫、猫……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f34fe251cad1bc7a5e038a2c742b11808c6b38eaeaaf972f57c187651c181900",
      "text": "嗯……真的，吓了一跳……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_b:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ae1a0f60df1bad2779b06c2aa1438907379f7b902ad6623ea9fe1323146fd87",
      "text": "确……确实，那种情况心跳会很快呢……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_c:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99a4d540da21e6cd81137945dfaab9dc34d2cd0f57d911689749e0022ae9376d",
      "text": "那么，下一个问题。你有喜欢的人吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_c:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d897a76ec85aec32d5c91b42107177700978eb4dcc89fda6fde4290238f8f4e8",
      "text": "喜欢的人……是旬。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_c:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5d4f6a680d1458eb3949e3e59dc568c9abfd03ad969215caf5e1b4e7c519469",
      "text": "旬是，我憧憬的人……\n听旬弹钢琴，就会觉得好幸福。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_c:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8948d07bb5677746a7805fdde6ee80ba0f6d5d4b5670e0f996c12ea7332b4177",
      "text": "原、原来如此……\n顺便问一下，除了旬先生以外还有别人吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_c:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f00b0279a75725d6a8f072dacf39a32d6bb3bb3dc3fd1a769ca10565db34e5c",
      "text": "旬以外……？嗯……\nHigh×Joker的大家，还有家人……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8251b24d83e1b566f5e844fbd0f28c715d419881802824f4af30bb73adc1331a",
      "text": "原来如此。\n夏来先生，其实啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36e49f274830722bf9f0b4663d111c407edafece623228563fb4ada2dc02b2ab",
      "text": "原来这个……是恋爱的提问啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dec2a98a2bdcdd7997e4143f7b921642639f2e68c678584e55207adeff676b6d",
      "text": "我，不擅长聊恋爱的话题……\n这个回答，不行吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_c:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7acb8175fcbfb71b1f7025ad193e767b029b8ba9534507bdbbd169d92b753a51",
      "text": "我想编辑部那边大概是想听听夏来先生关于恋爱的\n看法，不过……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d50f96e5e98883cb59836aa0b416f5411a81ddfd4c7cce4766f4883cdd48ad5d",
      "text": "我也觉得现在的回答更有夏来先生的风格。我去直接跟编辑部商量一下吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_c:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28b0af817c107fc610160b0f7d4cbe9986f782dfe768b19b4bb74b287ae85c49",
      "text": "真的吗？谢谢……\n●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_d:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_d:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5b96ce567c49ffabcfbee3dca015e96a3891b993a2e7be76329c2a097f150d6",
      "text": "……事情就是这样，我们希望能保留这次的回答\n进行刊登，您看如何呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_d:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c35ec041035760b7341776c7280844e9f2de294aa72c17f23ccf1b3b2c86be00",
      "text": "……好的，我觉得这种神秘感也非常棒！\n恋爱话题就特意以保密的形式呈现吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_d:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1299bf2a0cba72cb25b2f94654e0d1cdcc62f1e30182a4c160de9514868f0c1e",
      "text": "非常感谢！\n稍后由我转达给榊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d626721007611d76366dcf637e40e5faa6a29203ba109ddb342109e0828ae3a",
      "text": "今天请多……关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1072d1654693bf2688f0a5055843fc10eedea59aa7bdf63b651e5c929fe0c9ef",
      "text": "哪里哪里，今天也请多多关照！那么，\n先请视线移开一些，带着一种忧郁的感觉……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95b078384b7a81ee94f621f1647e8c0072634e1f1b189fc31382fa5ec3626f18",
      "text": "忧郁……那个……\n这样……吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_d:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:406a79341a7b740cea3fdd6cbe5b19948483ea39e4f164c743d89866f9438303",
      "text": "对，很好！接下来，视线稍微往这边看一点……\n带着窥探过来的感觉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_d:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:612bac37d2b76bf4737c96dc2301a8a9d4080e3a92a2a90fec8311940f9b947b",
      "text": "嗯，我知道了……\n那个……这样……？啊，是这边……吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_d:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:950b6b62dcfce2965e72f6de4276eb0c7bf44d7380f075071f0ea1a2c2a339ad",
      "text": "嗯嗯，非常棒……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_d:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5227210a74f337bfcedf674a5ff7e462c10455e10ed1b390f3fdee8faf5e02cb",
      "text": "（虽然本人慢条斯理的，但拍出来的照片真美啊……\n这种反差也是他的魅力所在呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_d:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7dbf01e42a6e590cb5ec6085a87b1b69ebfd54410964b5bf8d94808e3a6a3d70",
      "text": "辛苦了，制作人。\n我表现得，怎么样……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_d:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f3472b6ba4f1e6ea86b772d946faecc71da5b43ced10ac81710bf9ff1f70ca2",
      "text": "嗯！每一张都是非常棒的照片。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_e:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:317229e91d6ba6c45fca0754c38138394d350a2ce70fd3adb92a0ba939ef01dc",
      "text": "几个月后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:286c5be8526864d02af7bec27e3fe2ccc3cb342c1da9f1bd2ba4834c96b8632f",
      "text": "夏来先生，辛苦了。\n前阵子的那本杂志，您已经看过了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:adb630d551eda7da6203b50cb196f240dc9a9cfc32788c748dd2fe26bbfa1422",
      "text": "嗯……已经看过了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_e:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5913bae34c8f67a77db7fc5ea2e00f5db82607f03eab5a2d56ff3d650345b24",
      "text": "隼人说看到就买下来了，\n带到了社团活动室……四季也是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_e:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2edd0de30fb7462d84fa251e6fa6c949179af2c997a753942f7263945086daac",
      "text": "这样啊！\n那么，是和大家一起看的？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_e:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2766f665f9a5fb3202fc7cddd05d9efaab8100f0679b9adcc6e83fda1fd604a6",
      "text": "嗯。隼人和四季已经看过了……我和春名\n还有旬……一起看的。稍微，有点难为情……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9c2bc2ec3f33f2700a3277ac0536c4f28e15418da6ade4fdf44afea882aaa4f",
      "text": "四季说，采访内容很神秘……\n虽然我不是很懂……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4a64b9e99320681730c9ae47a6d6b954f01750e93812f84d2a3b04160ebd007",
      "text": "编辑部那边也说，访谈和照片的反差\n充满神秘感，好评如潮哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_e:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d59b7bbc31295b3a3f570d3472d9310e1e2e637d88eed215c7225e9fb60c118",
      "text": "这样啊……\n我只是和平常一样而已……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_e:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5e315349adfcb34e93bee7a904c757a75ca22623a3bf1e7fa01aff9eb78b1ce",
      "text": "那样的一面也是夏来先生的魅力所在！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_022nat_01_1_2_022_01:1_2_022_01_e:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87d6731722bb9a0c8190cf8781051f4feb28cfce0bcb11d10024ef2235402462",
      "text": "……是吗。既然●●●●プロデューサー都这么说了，\n那一定就是这样吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
